  m_Name: Carta_AgentesComunitariosDeSaude
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Agentes Comunit\xE1rios de Sa\xFAde"
  _titleEn: Community Health Agents
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Moradores do pr\xF3prio bairro, treinados pela sa\xFAde p\xFAblica,
    visitam casa a casa, acompanham gestantes, crian\xE7as e idosos e levam ao posto
    quem precisa."
  _summaryEn: Neighborhood residents trained by the public health system visit every
    home, follow pregnant women, children and the elderly, and refer those in need
    to the clinic.
  _realWorld: "O Cear\xE1 come\xE7ou com agentes em 1987, para gerar emprego na seca
    e reduzir a mortalidade infantil. O programa virou nacional em 1991 e chegou
    a cerca de 204 mil agentes no SUS em 2008."
  _realWorldEn: "Cear\xE1, in Brazil, started with health agents in 1987 to create
    jobs during the drought and cut infant mortality. The program went national in
    1991 and had about 204,000 agents by 2008."
  _tradeOffs: "Cada agente cuida de cerca de 150 fam\xEDlias e foi recebendo tarefas
    novas, como registro de dados e casos de viol\xEAncia, sem sal\xE1rio \xE0 altura."
  _tradeOffsEn: Each agent looks after about 150 families and kept getting new tasks,
    such as data entry and violence cases, without matching pay.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Agente comunit\xE1rio de sa\xFAde (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agente_comunit%C3%A1rio_de_sa%C3%BAde
